        {
          "text": "Umusi umwe Yesu yari ahantu ariko arasenga. Ahejeje, umwe mu bigishwa biwe aramubwira ati: “Mwami, twigishe gusenga nk’uko Yohana yavyigishije abigishwa biwe.”",
